Z||000007||007DOUG||01-31-2001||07:33 AM||||$80/month. Holy cow. Man, I'm not even going to tell you what I rent my monster garage for. It would make you sick.<P>Know any old ladies that don't drive? Before I got the garage I have now, I stored my fieros everywhere. And I mean EVERYWHERE. Most where in senior citizens garages. They couldn't drive, and had sold there cars. <P>------------------<BR>6 Indy pace Cars<BR>84 T-top<BR>86 SE V6 153K (daily)<BR>86 GT<BR>86 GT now with a 4:10<BR>86 GT 3.4 Pearl White T-top<BR>88 Coupe<BR>88 Formula 5 speed (soon)<BR>2 88 GT's (twins)<P>However......<BR><I>"Time is my most precious and most perishable of all my possessions."</I>||||reg||13
Z||000008||Fformula88||01-31-2001||02:04 PM||||I saw your appeal 87GTZ34.  Luckily, I have a couple things going for me here... first off is there is no "boss" as in a wife.  I am currently living at my parents house (I'm searching for a job now that I have my degree!).  Plus, I am not actually buying it.  My father is to go along with his 87 coupe.  Thats the car I list as rebuilding in my sig.  Were done and it turned out great, but he's just going to use it as a winter car.  He's getting an 85 SE V6 with 4 spd trans.  I personally own the Formula and Probe.<P>To answer your plea, my father convinced her that it doesn't make financial sense to get rid of the car and it will allow the new one to last longer.  She OK'd it, so the reasoning worked  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>John<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">     <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1987 Fiero Sport Coupe *In rebuilding*<BR>1997 Ford Probe SE<BR>AOL IM: Fformula88||||reg||1
Z||000009||rogergarrison||01-31-2001||04:23 PM||||why not check with someone who stores RVs and boats. some are indoor. I stored my boat indoors for $75 for 4 months off season. How about just a nice cover on it in some farmers pole barn. theyd love the extra cash since they dont have anything to do anyway, fields are frozen.<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 01-31-2001).]||||reg||1
